MIUI Gallery Decryptor is an offline Android application designed to decrypt and process encrypted media generated by supported MIUI Gallery versions. Your privacy is paramount: this Privacy Policy outlines how your data and files are handled.

​1. Zero Data Collection :

MIUI Gallery Decryptor operates entirely locally on your device without requiring an internet connection or account registration. The App does not collect, store, or transmit any data, including:
​Personal Information: Name, email, phone number, address, contacts, or account credentials.
​Files & Media: Photos, videos, encrypted files (.lsa, .lsav), decrypted media, or personal documents.
​Telemetry & Tracking: Location data, analytics, or developer tracking metrics.

​2. Local File & Media Processing :

All decryption operations occur strictly on-device. When you select an encrypted file, the App processes it locally using your device's processing capabilities. No file content or metadata ever leaves your device.

​3. File Storage & Output Control :

Processed and decrypted files are saved directly to your device’s local storage. You retain complete control over managing, moving, sharing, or deleting any files generated by the App.

​4. App Permissions :

The App uses standard Android file-selection mechanisms or requests necessary storage permissions solely to read encrypted input files and save decrypted outputs. Permissions are strictly limited to core functionality, and you can modify or revoke them at any time via Android System Settings.

​5. Contact :

If you have questions or feedback regarding this Privacy Policy, please reach out through the official GitHub repository or the contact details provided on the app store listing.